WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.182 --> 00:00:01.160
(cars honking)

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:02.956
- [Announcer] Hidden in New
York City's garment district,

00:00:02.956 --> 00:00:07.956
on 37th Street, between 8th
and 9th Avenues, building 306,

00:00:08.754 --> 00:00:11.818
lies a one-of-a-kind freight entrance,

00:00:11.818 --> 00:00:16.360
and inside, you'll find deliveries
and something delicious.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:18.379
You weren't expecting that, were you?

00:00:18.379 --> 00:00:19.833
I told you it was hidden.

00:00:21.563 --> 00:00:23.960
(upbeat music)
Inconspicuous at first,

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.090
but take a closer look
through these doors,

00:00:26.090 --> 00:00:29.112
and you'll find a small but
mighty Latin American restaurant

00:00:29.112 --> 00:00:31.350
called Aquario cafe.

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:32.750
Meet the owner.

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:41.827
Thank you, enjoy.

00:01:21.399 --> 00:01:22.379
Enjoy.

00:01:22.379 --> 00:01:24.354
(knife banging)

00:01:24.354 --> 00:01:27.160
- [Announcer] The menu
is constantly changing,

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:30.387
but customers can usually
expect pollo guisado,

00:01:30.387 --> 00:01:33.290
rabo guisado, espaguetis Dominicanos,

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:35.270
and the most popular of them all.

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:36.180
- Goat meat.

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:39.646
We gotta make everyday
because they love goat meat.

00:01:39.646 --> 00:01:42.750
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:44.400
- [Announcer] But I know
what you're thinking.

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:48.900
Why choose to open a restaurant
in such a small place?

00:02:06.284 --> 00:02:08.362
- [Announcer] He sells
hundreds of these plates a day,

00:02:08.362 --> 00:02:12.279
and his success is all
thanks to word of mouth.

00:02:27.121 --> 00:02:28.936
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:28.936 --> 00:02:31.769
I'm never going to move from here.

00:02:34.512 --> 00:02:37.179
(quirky music)

